    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This two-bedroom mid-terraced property with garden to the rear, offers a superb opportunity to renovate the entire property to your own choice, standard and finishes. \r\n\r\nNo.7 St Bridgets within walking distance of all amenities, is in need of complete repair and renovations throughout. A fantastic location in the centre of Longford Town, close to junior and secondary schools, selection of large supermarkets, The Cathedral, train station, swimming pool and restaurants. The property is fronted by a well-maintained common area, with parking to the front of the house along with off road parking to the rear, while there is independent access to the rear of the property just off the Athlone Road.\r\n\r\nVacant Property Refurbishment Grants are available for this type of property subject to the terms and conditions.\r\n \r\nPlease call to us at 53 Main Street, Longford, or phone us on 043-33 50555 to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nEIRCODE: N39 P9D8"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant available\r\n\r\nSEAI Energy Grants available also\r\n\r\n5 minute walk to the train station\r\n\r\nMains water and electricity\r\n\r\nVery convenient location to all local services\r\n\r\nIndependent access to the rear Garden\r\n\r\nDouble glazed pvc windows and door\r\n\r\nGarden shed\r\n\r\nSuits owner occupiers and investors"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: G"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Ballymahon Street, turn left down Kilashee Street. Take the first right, there is a green area to the left and the property is on the right hand side with our sign erected."
      }
    ],
